    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 64,
        "text": "Hi, Mark! I haven't seen you for ages. How have you been?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "966036e04b32c7c66ef4e6fc23ce52d9a9c5754c2eee7a91dfa879abef4b5fda",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 70,
        "sourceEnd": 165,
        "text": "Lucy! Good to see you. I've been really busy. I've just started a new job at a language school.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "0ef77a51c17a3d4927c8b17138e6c6674ff8fa2910fee3c5e13ba75a7858f207",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 173,
        "sourceEnd": 270,
        "text": "That's great! I've heard you wanted to change jobs for a long time. How long have you been there?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "3924cc0d728713ab7d04e272bbef053ccf0e43b4b8eb90867ea68134ccac87e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 276,
        "sourceEnd": 361,
        "text": "Only for two weeks. But I've already taught three classes. The students are friendly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "bb92b3f231130027709fcdac66ae29f661f20d52c4a697bf0c8a07b99a0ebd9d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 369,
        "sourceEnd": 417,
        "text": "Nice. And have you moved to a new apartment yet?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c41dbd00d62effcaf7e8430aa625d7012d95b3ac6ad2af1ad311b7ef9d5f3d66",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 423,
        "sourceEnd": 522,
        "text": "Yes, I have. I've lived in the new place since last month. It's near the school, so I walk to work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "c2ec845d87d45e86d7c993c6f99fb86d888969936c68a82d62a0d411e48035bc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 530,
        "sourceEnd": 674,
        "text": "That sounds perfect. I've been a teacher for five years now, but I've never worked at a language school. I've always taught at a primary school.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "a51c2701fecc2232af471356cb3a79537a171088013216f1db2e0b061c877f04",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 680,
        "sourceEnd": 717,
        "text": "Have you ever thought about changing?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "02cc57e0c5041c6cc866fe532e55ac9cd2d796e3624a89be9386d340b5ea26fd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 725,
        "sourceEnd": 845,
        "text": "Well, I've already decided to take a course in teaching English to adults. I haven't started it yet, but I've signed up.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "7dc40dd66a277ae2a00d15b07a037a2b1c825d795028176bdb7216669b959c86",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 851,
        "sourceEnd": 925,
        "text": "Good for you! I took a similar course three years ago. It helped me a lot.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "06b72d56751f612faed852dd33cb4a647be203114a508b1a3f2e96cced9efed8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 933,
        "sourceEnd": 962,
        "text": "Really? How long did it take?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "270dc0f5b3359a6f4c419ab4db8e5f480dd2e805a18795e912cf673848da36cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 968,
        "sourceEnd": 1010,
        "text": "It took six months. I finished it in 2020.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "31c0a9dbd816566a1eccbdea3429ad7199c0bf7f3413ebc2542ba797b900998a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 1018,
        "sourceEnd": 1077,
        "text": "And have you kept in touch with your classmates since then?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "f43a0dfa7bd51ff04e232486dac1b364541fe7c3fc3676f1b35390c5281dfe55",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 1083,
        "sourceEnd": 1173,
        "text": "Some of them, yes. I've known one friend since the course. We meet for coffee every month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "f8384717271b88f2876ae6b517dcddc3255c0c005d0a0b17c33a3240ad4267c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 1181,
        "sourceEnd": 1228,
        "text": "That's nice. I hope I'll make good friends too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "d3ae58135188ef1bed4233d67ebe87b74d3206fd28105b6c5a36fe15bf563951",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "man",
        "speaker": "Man",
        "sourceStart": 1234,
        "sourceEnd": 1336,
        "text": "You will. By the way, I've just remembered—there's a free workshop next week. Have you heard about it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "1775523198325470ba82cbabd7cd2fb22ab017d2389568f449b3e85f69db745f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "woman",
        "speaker": "Woman",
        "sourceStart": 1344,
        "sourceEnd": 1405,
        "text": "No, I haven't. Thanks for telling me! I'll check the website.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "0f1dd55ec0964bd2e032411c231e2733d79a26fe21ef9f929efee5ede29c358d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
